{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/pcfqjux182o5llag83p3ru0rphqhk6d.mp3","text":"今天的工作可真不少啊。所以，博士，要不要先玩玩游戏？最好的工作准备，难道不正是一份放松的心情吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/j26j918rdlpz62cfg3ytzt5weo381rg.mp3","text":"唔，总觉得好没劲，是不是因为月见夜不在啊？每当我看到他笑容闪耀，向着女生们搭讪再遭拒绝的场面，这一整天的心情，可就好得不得了~","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bd/jdg83v624ahkn37cky5iqhxzee7ovu0.mp3","text":"博士，你知道我们小组里谁最可靠吗？猜不出来吧？是斑点哦。别看他不常说话，做起事可是非常靠谱的。所以~如果干活的话，为什么不把他叫过来呢？现在只有我们两人，多累啊~","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/nn0xy7qgfyqr3rzy0j4fltpi0fnf54u.mp3","text":"哎~又被梓兰姐训了一顿......她也太爱操心了吧？一定是工作压力太大了~她还是得学学我，我可是最擅长寻找工作和休息中的平衡点的那种人~！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/2t1z14tj77zds2kbpvt8v9eg2z0byba.mp3","text":"嗯？杜宾教官，今天是不是不在？出差去了？......哼哼，终于！终于又能轻轻松松地过一天了！太棒了！博士我马上要去买点零食，你想吃薯片还是爆米花？让我帮你带一份！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/7fp02bors24vep8u1w8n4a7x69ckhec.mp3","text":"听、听我说小泡普卡，吵架什么的，我不会再干了！放、放下电锯吧！......惨了惨了，她暴走了啊！这、这可完蛋了，快跑博士，从窗户跳下去！别管了，快和我一起跳！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/13vvqo5z6nce8vcp9re1vkwy4z7seq9.mp3","text":"我们当时在的那个小城啊，城镇里的大伙都被城主逼得活不下去，我也很讨厌那个脑满肠肥的家伙，就把他的金库炸了，把钱发给大家自谋生计去。想了想，还真是很痛快的经历嘛~","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/20/s685r4rg9jcl09tdzgp7lj2ixdrbril.mp3","text":"别人怎么评价我我可不在乎。我只在乎自己每天过得舒不舒服，是不是在做自己乐意做的事。人生是自己的，就应该由自己去掌握，难道不是吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/ho7z6inn47qnc9rnhskf5tl8e7muve1.mp3","text":"博士睡着了？嚯~这时候可不能打扰博士休息。所以，我就先出门走走吧~","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/g37hv9ou7cge4jwqkqnl13nf3iyhym6.mp3","text":"行动预备组A6，空爆，前来报到！哎呀~我一眼就能看出来，你和那个死板的，啊不，令人尊敬的教官杜宾小姐，可是一点都不一样，对吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/n53ax784px0pnxumn6066ky3menp8gm.mp3","text":"......唔唔，这一觉睡得可真香啊～","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/pcmpgl0925bzufy64vulqukl0gpi8eb.mp3","text":"哼哼，总算要和新人训练营告别了......什么什么？新进干员晋升之后还是由杜宾小姐管理？你骗我的吧——？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/kddqql2gjwkm70ylfcetzjnpn64qz8m.mp3","text":"还没到出发时间吧？那我再去逛会儿~","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/8owxap453wn5m9xa2puxj3zkevn7ge4.mp3","text":"任命队长？哈~我等这句话好久了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/01bi47tc39k84dvrtpo7tsf9dg6lk3s.mp3","text":"唔？弹链被我放到哪去了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/cp1j7w215mrxtf5ubuq58xzc7urwdw2.mp3","text":"唉，我还是很讨厌战争啊，可也没办法。","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:4/43/53ja28c9dgc9xpk6rvcumd93oy3d809.mp3","text":"你说~","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/56/0zeipnlejq1239w8tx7287ggshggoga.mp3","text":"我一定听指挥~","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/enmyr0m9v9s9qj6xa3x09hsbv5guwon.mp3","text":"安全着陆！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/owk6x6u09fp5hf0agj0oy9ho9726haj.mp3","text":"开工了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/2dczu9jl467n9yyl26y9zx8odqwki3n.mp3","text":"就用这一发子弹，看准了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/07/a4xrb1fzwrtcbqaf3yv4tx80ayg6vun.mp3","text":"你们全都给我飞上天！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/fu8wibdxpewzx61fv4e63oewq2yqzua.mp3","text":"刚才那个击破敌人的战术，布置得可真是漂亮啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/9u47r0nlcbe36z8oo3e57exzryyhqi9.mp3","text":"我就是喜欢能带我们打胜仗的指挥官，就像博士这样的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/n609nfhntck1u6wwrdnkurwxo7icciv.mp3","text":"放心~我早就在敌人的撤退路线上设陷阱了~欸？一个也没被踩中？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/3udf0oii1rt4ohgrtu9ia7wdchqbkan.mp3","text":"唉......！别磨蹭啦，逃吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/qmwle7anok6k77kxrhak6iz9yldjejm.mp3","text":"嘿~帮我看下，杜宾教官，在不在这个房间里面？","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/tftfrwfz1ndpvpmg1acnha3gmw9ftr8.mp3","text":"我跑！跑不掉啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/gh48bqnrkbyffglgnxpah7bt9dzwwkw.mp3","text":"博士，是一位好长官！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/7rxefe8sd22yplueivq4dcwyyh9xza3.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/84/oooyq3nepc0jwae9lto9aicnyjpc7tg.mp3","text":"博士！快！就是现在！立刻放下你手中的工作！难得的年假，当然应该把所有烦心事扔得远远的，待在屋子里怎么行？我们现在就出去玩吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/0kvy68hj6hom3o6jxo3qbbhnma6ntwt.mp3","text":"博士~我在这儿呢！","alt":"voice_cn/char_282_catap/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/o26wo8q7d3fjc035ttmsb9i91hh33eb.mp3","text":"今天的工作可真不少啊。所以，博士，要不要先玩玩游戏？最好的工作准备，难道不正是一份放松的心情吗？","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/mxh33gedlrbd0drxclp5cffc1xegkev.mp3","text":"唔，总觉得好没劲，是不是因为月见夜不在啊？每当我看到他笑容闪耀，向着女生们搭讪再遭拒绝的场面，这一整天的心情，可就好得不得了~","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/49/r3r0wr0z7ysmwu6wlfo2hfgc2u08dag.mp3","text":"博士，你知道我们小组里谁最可靠吗？猜不出来吧？是斑点哦。别看他不常说话，做起事可是非常靠谱的。所以~如果干活的话，为什么不把他叫过来呢？现在只有我们两人，多累啊~","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/36/nqxlq58rkxcnloo23w9ulwdtvlkzzu2.mp3","text":"哎~又被梓兰姐训了一顿......她也太爱操心了吧？一定是工作压力太大了~她还是得学学我，我可是最擅长寻找工作和休息中的平衡点的那种人~！","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/eombpakxhwkyyj811rzpfmavuto41ot.mp3","text":"嗯？杜宾教官，今天是不是不在？出差去了？......哼哼，终于！终于又能轻轻松松地过一天了！太棒了！博士我马上要去买点零食，你想吃薯片还是爆米花？让我帮你带一份！","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/2zxc4dt212skfbp1koej5a04xfmhjib.mp3","text":"听、听我说小泡普卡，吵架什么的，我不会再干了！放、放下电锯吧！......惨了惨了，她暴走了啊！这、这可完蛋了，快跑博士，从窗户跳下去！别管了，快和我一起跳！","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/b6ksds21giqcdbygeztyh3pk4ubaiqt.mp3","text":"我们当时在的那个小城啊，城镇里的大伙都被城主逼得活不下去，我也很讨厌那个脑满肠肥的家伙，就把他的金库炸了，把钱发给大家自谋生计去。想了想，还真是很痛快的经历嘛~","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/4po89awzbyrbf308ypkb2zqv5opwjm1.mp3","text":"别人怎么评价我我可不在乎。我只在乎自己每天过得舒不舒服，是不是在做自己乐意做的事。人生是自己的，就应该由自己去掌握，难道不是吗？","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/rsd7k6wkjr5ixarwj9zgp4wkd014zdd.mp3","text":"博士睡着了？嚯~这时候可不能打扰博士休息。所以，我就先出门走走吧~","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/2mr151qkm7x0n4io61rf8lwhny600hp.mp3","text":"行动预备组A6，空爆，前来报到！哎呀~我一眼就能看出来，你和那个死板的，啊不，令人尊敬的教官杜宾小姐，可是一点都不一样，对吧？","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/igcri0ifetw7b5ivw4tfvg1qi9kyesi.mp3","text":"......唔唔，这一觉睡得可真香啊～","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/igw18i375np9g5nyou17w57057lhm9v.mp3","text":"哼哼，总算要和新人训练营告别了......什么什么？新进干员晋升之后还是由杜宾小姐管理？你骗我的吧——？！","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/qmgabsnxk3azbd3crqjuo6pnid4o4fq.mp3","text":"还没到出发时间吧？那我再去逛会儿~","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/bcbz21u4i5ss7lkr6sva3bcu1hriqnv.mp3","text":"任命队长？哈~我等这句话好久了！","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/pvksdq1i8joxaig2rfvaabyjhc38tn1.mp3","text":"唔？弹链被我放到哪去了？","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/93/5tpr5wnlvivg872amawjc1ezet1sonq.mp3","text":"唉，我还是很讨厌战争啊，可也没办法。","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/6b86plo08hqquljshs7ccd35zaecwm2.mp3","text":"你说~","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/55/mp4ahhl4r3mpx9hbsfxm01i5j6kh1s9.mp3","text":"我一定听指挥~","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/mw5uuyw9sysegq7bzqoidkd9t5v3u6f.mp3","text":"安全着陆！","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/84/3euy6pd321kmcmrkm9k1gjqzo91aqu0.mp3","text":"开工了！","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/hj8sw4fdeo95iiy77m3j1tzinsu0kf4.mp3","text":"就用这一发子弹，看准了！","alt":"voice/char_282_catap/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/ft2ey66k